<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia September CPI down 0.04 pct - sources.</title>
<headline>Indonesia September CPI down 0.04 pct - sources.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's consumer price index fell 0.04 percent month-on-month in September against a rise of 0.27 percent in August, government sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said a fall in food prices was mainly responsible, but added full details would be given after the monthly meeting of the cabinet.</p>
